     1,
     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:blue\">Hi Andrea,<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:blue\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:blue\">Perfect timing. Kristin Broms has just published this neat paper:<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:blue\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:blue\">Model selection and assessment for multi-species occupancy models<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:blue\"><a href=\"http://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1890/15-1471.1/abstract\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1890/15-1471.1/abstract&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792495100967000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2USeuXOzipxonE5S6Rv3Hb\">http://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1890/15-1471.1/abstract</a><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:blue\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:blue\">Seems like this should be just what you need, right?<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:blue\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:blue\">Chris<u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div>"
