 style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"></span></a><a href=\"http://inta.gob.ar/personas/goijman.andrea/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://inta.gob.ar/personas/goijman.andrea/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792495100973000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2BbDOzba87TtyVdK4gIEmS\">http://inta.gob.ar/personas/goijman.andrea/</a></font></div></div></div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n"
